<title>INDONESIA: Semen Gresik 9-mth net soars.</title>
<headline>Semen Gresik 9-mth net soars.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   193.98 vs 85.44</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah) 327.02 vs 493.88</p>
<p>    Net sales			   992.15  vs 407.30</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   238.84 vs 104.18</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Semen Gresik is one of Indonesia's largest cement firms.</p>
</text>
